# Code owners for DungeonLike.
#
# Every pull request touching a matched path automatically requests review from
# the listed owner. Ownership is enforced only if "Require review from Code
# Owners" is enabled in the repository's branch protection settings.
#
# Rules are evaluated in order; the LAST matching rule wins. The catch-all is
# therefore declared first, and progressively more specific paths follow.

# Default owner for everything in the repository.
*                                   @4Luke4

# --- Sources of truth --------------------------------------------------------
# Changing a source of truth silently re-points every consumer of that value, so
# these paths are called out separately to make such changes conspicuous in review.
/VERSION                            @4Luke4
/config/                            @4Luke4
/gradle/libs.versions.toml          @4Luke4

